%% Task C request flow (Stage 01 plan): endpoint config, outbox emission, worker delivery.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Company admin (browser)
    actor FL as Freelancer (browser)
    participant FE as React SPA
    participant API as DRF APIView
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant W as deliver_webhooks worker
    participant R as Receiver (localhost:8027/hook)

    Note over Admin,DB: Configure endpoint
    Admin->>FE: URL + description
    FE->>API: POST /api/webhook-endpoints/
    API->>DB: insert WebhookEndpoint (company = admin.company, secret generated)
    API-->>FE: 201 {id, url, active, secret} (secret shown once)

    Note over Admin,R: Send test event (inline first attempt)
    FE->>API: POST /api/webhook-endpoints/{id}/test/
    API->>DB: insert WebhookDelivery(webhook.test)
    API->>R: signed POST (5 s timeout)
    R-->>API: 2xx / error
    API->>DB: insert WebhookDeliveryAttempt, update status
    API-->>FE: delivery with attempt result

    Note over FL,DB: Emit timesheet.submitted (outbox)
    FL->>FE: submit hours
    FE->>API: POST /api/timesheets/
    activate API
    API->>DB: BEGIN
    API->>DB: insert TimesheetEntry(status=submitted)
    API->>DB: insert WebhookDelivery per active endpoint of company
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    deactivate API
    API-->>FE: 201 entry

    Note over W,R: Asynchronous delivery with retries
    loop every --interval seconds
        W->>DB: select due pending rows FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, push next_attempt_at (lease)
        W->>R: POST payload v1, YJ-Webhook-Id / -Event / -Attempt / -Signature
        alt 2xx
            W->>DB: attempt row, status = succeeded
        else non-2xx, timeout, connection error
            W->>DB: attempt row, next_attempt_at += 1m, 5m, 30m, 2h, 6h
            Note right of W: after attempt 6 fails: status = failed
        end
    end

    Note over Admin,DB: Delivery log
    FE->>API: GET /api/webhook-endpoints/{id}/deliveries/ (polled every 5 s)
    API->>DB: newest 50 deliveries + attempts, scoped to company
    API-->>FE: deliveries[]
